{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/each-room-s-supervisor-install-runs-its-own-team",
  "title": "One supervisor serves every room a Supervisor is installed in, each install with its own team: a room's delegate_workers declares and runs that room's workers, a team still running in one room holds up no call of another, and a room the supervisor serves with no install declares no delegation tool",
  "rules": [
    "§19.7.3",
    "§23.3"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/orchestration/test_room_installs.py test_each_room_s_team_tool_runs_its_own_team, test_a_room_without_the_install_gets_the_supervisor_s_own_answer; tests/orchestration/test_supervisor_room_state.py test_one_rooms_pipeline_does_not_hold_up_another_rooms_call; tests/orchestration/test_strategy_behavioral.py TestSupervisorHandlerIdempotency::test_each_room_s_install_serves_its_own_room; tests/orchestration/test_call_room.py test_a_supervisor_shared_by_two_rooms_delegates_from_the_room_that_asked. orchestration/strategies/supervisor/_inject_strategy.py (owner_tools_of(...).register(entry, room_id=room_id, owner=self), a lock per room). The bank's worker waits at its gate while the clinic's team runs and answers.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms1",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "sms2",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "sms3",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "sup",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Coordinator"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "c1",
                  "name": "delegate_workers",
                  "arguments": {
                    "task": "Bank"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "c2",
                  "name": "delegate_workers",
                  "arguments": {
                    "task": "Clinic"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Clinic, done."
            },
            {
              "text": "Bank, done."
            },
            {
              "text": "Hello."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "banker",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Banker"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Accounts.",
              "gate": "banker"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nurse",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Nurse"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Patients."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "r1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "r2",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "r3",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms3"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "sup",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "strategies": [
      {
        "id": "bank",
        "supervisor": {
          "supervisor": "sup",
          "workers": [
            "banker"
          ],
          "strategy": "parallel"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "clinic",
        "supervisor": {
          "supervisor": "sup",
          "workers": [
            "nurse"
          ],
          "strategy": "parallel"
        }
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "seen",
        "trigger": "on_ai_response",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "install_strategy",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "strategy": "bank"
    },
    {
      "call": "install_strategy",
      "room_id": "r2",
      "strategy": "clinic"
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms1",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Check the bank."
        }
      },
      "background": true,
      "as": "bank"
    },
    {
      "wait_for": "banker"
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r2",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms2",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Check the clinic."
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "open": "banker"
    },
    {
      "await": "bank",
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r3",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms3",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Hi."
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "status.recent",
      "agent_id": "nurse",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Clinic",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r2",
              "strategy": "parallel"
            }
          },
          {
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "Patients.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r2"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "r1": [
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sms1"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_call_start"
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_call_end"
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sup"
          },
          "content": {
            "body": "Bank, done."
          }
        }
      ],
      "r2": [
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sms2"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_call_start"
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_call_end"
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sup"
          },
          "content": {
            "body": "Clinic, done."
          }
        }
      ],
      "r3": [
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sms3"
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sup"
          },
          "content": {
            "body": "Hello."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "rooms": {
      "r3": {
        "metadata": {
          "_conversation_state": {
            "$absent": true
          }
        }
      },
      "r2": {
        "metadata": {
          "_conversation_state": {
            "phase": "supervisor",
            "active_agent_id": "sup",
            "previous_agent_id": null,
            "handoff_count": 0,
            "phase_history": [],
            "context": {}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "bindings": {
      "r1": {
        "banker": null,
        "nurse": null
      },
      "r2": {
        "banker": null,
        "nurse": null
      }
    },
    "models": {
      "sup": [
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Check the bank."
            }
          ],
          "tools": {
            "delegate_workers": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Check the clinic."
            }
          ],
          "tools": {
            "delegate_workers": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Check the clinic."
            },
            {},
            {}
          ]
        },
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Check the bank."
            },
            {},
            {}
          ]
        },
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Hi."
            }
          ],
          "tools": {
            "delegate_workers": {
              "$absent": true
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "banker": [
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Bank"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nurse": [
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Clinic"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "hooks": {
      "seen": [
        {
          "room_id": "$r2",
          "response": {
            "channel_id": "nurse"
          }
        },
        {
          "room_id": "r2",
          "response": {
            "channel_id": "sup",
            "declared_tools": {
              "delegate_workers": {
                "description": "Delegate a task to ALL workers (Nurse) at once. Call this tool exactly ONCE with the topic. All workers run automatically in parallel mode. Do NOT split into separate calls per worker."
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "room_id": "$r1",
          "response": {
            "channel_id": "banker"
          }
        },
        {
          "room_id": "r1",
          "response": {
            "channel_id": "sup",
            "declared_tools": {
              "delegate_workers": {
                "description": "Delegate a task to ALL workers (Banker) at once. Call this tool exactly ONCE with the topic. All workers run automatically in parallel mode. Do NOT split into separate calls per worker."
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "room_id": "r3",
          "response": {
            "channel_id": "sup",
